WEBVTT

00:00.320 --> 00:09.920
Enough. This matter ends here. The treasonous cabal tied to the seditious poem has been thoroughly executed, without a single soul spared. As for Yu Gong...

00:14.840 --> 00:24.080
The Imperial City Guard certainly keeps a sharp eye on you. The moment Chu Huan mobilized men, their report landed directly upon my desk.

00:31.280 --> 00:39.000
As for you: decisive in action, ruthless in execution, silver-tongued... and utterly devoid of mercy.
Father—

00:40.080 --> 00:49.280
In this world, you are not the only clever man under heaven. Hear me well, my second son: one mistake I can overlook. There will not be a second.

00:50.600 --> 00:53.500
As for that Yu Gong... let him languish for now.

00:56.320 --> 01:03.000
You haven't visited the palace in quite some time. Stay and play a game of Weiqi with me.
Yes, Father Emperor.
